I think this is a much stronger direction for CHANGE360. You're combining AI-powered social awareness, real-world action, gamification, and automatically generated impact posters into one application. The poster feature could become the app's signature feature because it gives users something visual they can share to inspire others.

The important part is to make sure the app doesn't just reward people for using it. It should reward meaningful participation and help users understand the difference their actions make.
🌍 CHANGE360 — Turning Awareness into Action
Tagline: Learn. Act. Track. Inspire.
1. Your Signature Feature: AI Impact Poster Generator 🎨











Here's how I envision your idea working.

Whenever a user completes an activity, participates in a challenge, or performs an approved social awareness task, CHANGE360 records their progress.

The user can then generate a personalised poster showing their contribution.
Three types of posters
A. Daily Impact Poster

Generated at the end of the day or whenever the user chooses.

Example:
